ning recovered system, restored services and configuration, and successful post-restart banner tests. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["One early SSH probe did not capture the banner, despite later pre-reboot and post-reboot probes succeeding with otherwise equivalent options (cmd-7dab7777515f45a2).","Local behavior was tested using agetty’s issue renderer in a pseudo-terminal rather than by capturing the already-running tty1 or ttyS0 login prompt directly; active getty services and the successful post-reboot rendering provide strong corroboration."]}
